cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Telescoping link gauges in backpropagation: a structural
  analysis of the KarcıFANN update
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tonyalı
    given-names: Samet
    affiliation: Gümüşhane University
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7799-2771
license: MIT
keywords:
  - fractional-order derivative
  - backpropagation
  - learning rate
  - functional equation
  - neural network optimisation
abstract: >-
  A NumPy implementation and empirical study of Karcı fractional artificial
  neural networks, together with a characterisation theorem showing that a
  per-link gauge collapses a backpropagation chain if and only if it has the
  form g(a)/g(b).
